WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.467 --> 00:00:18.328
"Zann! You're safe!" Perda rushed into Venna's hideout with Darb and Teplo behind her.

2
00:00:18.329 --> 00:00:22.756
While Teplo talked to Venna and her people, Zann's friends pulled him aside.

3
00:00:22.757 --> 00:00:26.610
"Wow, I'm glad to see you guys," Zann said.

4
00:00:26.611 --> 00:00:32.355
Half an hour had passed since Venna had asked him to become king, and he was still stunned.

5
00:00:32.356 --> 00:00:37.944
"What's going on?" Perda asked. "That messenger who came to get us wouldn't tell us anything.

6
00:00:37.945 --> 00:00:41.045
Just that he was taking us to you."

7
00:00:41.046 --> 00:00:43.509
"Did you find Gliss?" Darb added.

8
00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:47.256
"No," Zann said. "I never made it to the zoo."

9
00:00:47.257 --> 00:00:50.475
He quickly told them what had happened.

10
00:00:50.476 --> 00:00:56.992
Perda gasped. "They want you to be king?" she exclaimed. "But you're a kid!"

11
00:00:56.993 --> 00:01:01.707
"That's what I said," Zann agreed. "But Venna said it didn't matter.

12
00:01:01.708 --> 00:01:06.355
She said Boz was so popular here that the people would love me.

13
00:01:06.356 --> 00:01:10.955
And she needs someone who's sure to be more popular than Slib."

14
00:01:10.956 --> 00:01:14.840
"So Slib really is trying to take over?" said Darb.

15
00:01:14.841 --> 00:01:22.094
"That's not all," Zann said. "Yog says he's pretty sure Slib sent us that password!"

16
00:01:22.095 --> 00:01:25.389
"Why would he do that?" asked Perda.

17
00:01:25.390 --> 00:01:32.071
"So we'd go out and get captured by trolls," Zann replied. "Especially me and Gliss.

18
00:01:32.072 --> 00:01:37.278
Yog says Slib resents all Reds and thinks we have too much power."

19
00:01:37.279 --> 00:01:39.736
"Kind of like Jev," Darb said.

20
00:01:39.737 --> 00:01:44.632
Zann nodded. "Anyway, Venna doesn't want Slib to take over.

21
00:01:44.633 --> 00:01:48.040
That's why she wants me to volunteer to be king."

22
00:01:48.041 --> 00:01:50.792
"So what did you say?" Perda asked.

23
00:01:50.793 --> 00:01:57.501
"At first I said no way. But now that I've thought about it . . . " Zann shrugged.

24
00:01:57.502 --> 00:02:06.327
"Venna's really powerful and smart. I figured we might have a better chance of rescuing Gliss and defeating Morb if we all work together."

25
00:02:06.328 --> 00:02:09.595
"Did Venna say she'd help find Gliss?" Darb asked.

26
00:02:09.596 --> 00:02:14.685
"She promised she'd take care of it as soon as she made things official," Zann said.

27
00:02:14.686 --> 00:02:20.897
"She’s already sent a messenger to her contacts at the palace to tell them I'm ready to become king."

28
00:02:20.898 --> 00:02:26.365
He gulped nervously. Was he really ready to be king of Magica?

29
00:02:26.366 --> 00:02:30.378
Just then he noticed that Teplo was frowning as he talked to Venna.

30
00:02:30.379 --> 00:02:32.978
By now two other Reds had arrived.

31
00:02:32.979 --> 00:02:37.235
"Maybe we should go see what they're talking about," Zann suggested.

32
00:02:37.237 --> 00:02:40.029
When the kids walked over, Teplo was speaking.

33
00:02:40.030 --> 00:02:44.940
". . . and I agree that Boz's grandson could rally the citizens," he said.

34
00:02:44.941 --> 00:02:52.127
"But at what cost to Zann himself? Surely Morb will be on the lookout for him above all others!"

35
00:02:52.128 --> 00:02:58.086
"That may be," Venna said. "But Zann is brave enough to take on the responsibility.

36
00:02:58.087 --> 00:03:03.125
We can keep him safe if we work together."

37
00:03:03.126 --> 00:03:06.668
"Don't underestimate Morb, Venna," Teplo warned.

38
00:03:06.669 --> 00:03:12.127
He turned to Zann. "Listen, my boy. Think this scheme over carefully."

39
00:03:12.128 --> 00:03:16.909
"I have," said Zann. "Venna says she'll help me rescue Gliss.

40
00:03:16.910 --> 00:03:20.508
Then we can work on finding Boz and the others."

41
00:03:20.509 --> 00:03:23.973
"That's right, Zann," Venna said smoothly.

42
00:03:23.974 --> 00:03:30.090
Teplo still looked skeptical. "How do you propose to do that?" he asked Venna.

43
00:03:30.091 --> 00:03:34.564
One of the other Reds spoke up. "This argument is a waste of time.

44
00:03:34.565 --> 00:03:40.629
Zann already said yes. And Slib is wasting no time trying to solidify his power.

45
00:03:40.630 --> 00:03:45.741
We need to show our candidate to the people of Magica as soon as possible."

46
00:03:45.742 --> 00:03:52.116
"I agree," Venna said. "Sorry, Teplo. I'm afraid you're outvoted."

47
00:03:52.117 --> 00:03:56.925
The old man sputtered with indignation. But she ignored him, turning to Zann.

48
00:03:56.926 --> 00:04:03.359
"It's time to make final preparations. I want to coach you on what to say when you address the public.

49
00:04:03.360 --> 00:04:07.262
And of course we'll have to do something about your clothes . . ."

50
00:04:07.263 --> 00:04:15.259
Zann nodded, feeling overwhelmed. But he was ready to go along with whatever Venna said so they could move on to finding Gliss and Boz.

51
00:04:15.260 --> 00:04:18.244
Soon he was surrounded by Venna's assistants.

52
00:04:18.245 --> 00:04:22.177
Yog removed Zann's disguise to reveal his hair and freckles.

53
00:04:22.178 --> 00:04:25.505
Others conjured a fresh set of clothes.

54
00:04:25.506 --> 00:04:28.224
In the midst of all this, the door flew open.

55
00:04:28.225 --> 00:04:32.934
Before Zann could look to see who had arrived, he heard a familiar whistle.

56
00:04:32.935 --> 00:04:39.080
He spun around. "Zing!" he cried happily as his dragon flew in just ahead of Fala.

57
00:04:39.081 --> 00:04:44.670
"Surprise!" Perda exclaimed. "We didn't want to tell you in case it didn't work.

58
00:04:44.671 --> 00:04:47.773
But Teplo thought he could get Zing back."

59
00:04:47.774 --> 00:04:53.889
Zann gave the dragon a scratch on the head, ignoring the burn of Zing's fiery breath on his face.

60
00:04:53.890 --> 00:04:59.352
"Good to have you back, little buddy." He looked around, wanting to thank Teplo.

61
00:04:59.353 --> 00:05:02.766
The old man was huddled with Fala. Both of them looked worried.

62
00:05:02.767 --> 00:05:06.549
A moment later Teplo strode to the center of the room.

63
00:05:06.550 --> 00:05:10.493
"My assistant has brought troubling news," he announced.

64
00:05:10.494 --> 00:05:15.995
"She just discovered that the trolls have nearly filled the dragon pen at the zoo with prisoners.

65
00:05:15.996 --> 00:05:21.348
They intend to zap them all to Morb's dungeon as soon as they capture one more Red."

66
00:05:21.349 --> 00:05:26.666
Zann gasped. "Gliss!" He rushed over to Venna. "Did you hear that?

67
00:05:26.667 --> 00:05:28.963
This king stuff will have to wait.

68
00:05:28.964 --> 00:05:34.021
We've got to figure out how to rescue Gliss and the others at the zoo—now!"

69
00:05:34.022 --> 00:05:38.820
Venna traded a look with the other Reds. "I'm sorry, Zann," she said.

70
00:05:38.821 --> 00:05:43.825
"Things have already been set in motion. We must proceed as planned."

71
00:05:43.826 --> 00:05:47.056
"But you said you'd help me rescue my friend!"

72
00:05:47.057 --> 00:05:52.138
"I said I'll help you after you become king," Venna replied.

73
00:05:52.139 --> 00:05:57.585
"If we don't act now, Slib will be able to take power uncontested."

74
00:05:57.586 --> 00:05:59.576
"But—" Zann began.

75
00:05:59.577 --> 00:06:03.227
Venna interrupted him. "This is not open for debate.

76
00:06:03.228 --> 00:06:07.101
If you're going to become king, it must be now."

77
00:06:07.102 --> 00:06:18.134
Then Teplo spoke up. "Well, Zann," he said quietly, "it seems you have a decision to make."
